{
  "title": "EC2 Purchasing Options · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "작업 중단 가능성과 사용 약정에 따라 비용 옵션을 고른다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Purchasing Options</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-Demand Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-interruption-and-rebalance\">Spot Interruption and Rebalance</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-fleet-and-ec2-fleet\">Spot Fleet and EC2 Fleet</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Compute Savings Plans</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#ec2-instance-savings-plans\">EC2 Instance Savings Plans</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#other-savings-plans\">Other Savings Plans</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#standard-reserved-instances\">Standard Reserved Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#convertible-reserved-instances\">Convertible Reserved Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional and Zonal Reserved Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#all-upfront-partial-upfront-and-no-upfront\">All Upfront, Partial Upfront and No Upfront</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">On-Demand Capacity Reservations</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#capacity-blocks\">Capacity Blocks</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>17 / 62</span></div><h1>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Purchasing Options</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 15 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Purchasing Options는 비용 할인, Capacity 확보, Hardware 전용 사용이라는 서로 다른 목표를 다룬다. 먼저 중단 가능성·사용 예측·약정 기간·라이선스 요구를 분리해서 판단한다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#standard-reserved-instances\">Reserved Instances</a>는 기본적으로 Billing Discount를 제공한다. Dedicated는 Hardware Tenancy를, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>은 특정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 실행 용량을 다룬다. 할인 약정을 샀다고 모든 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 Instance 시작 용량이 확보되는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"할인·용량·Hardware 요구의 분리\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>할인·용량·Hardware 요구의 분리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Billing and capacity</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Steady usage</strong><small>기간·사용 금액 예측</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a> / RI</strong><small>일치 사용량 할인</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a></strong><small>지정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 용량은 별도 확인</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Hardware tenancy</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a></strong><small>다른 계정과 Hardware 격리</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Host control required</strong><small>Socket·Core·Placement 요구</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a></strong><small>Physical Host 단위 제어</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a>은 중단 가능성, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-Demand</a>는 무약정, Dedicated는 Hardware 사용 조건을 다룬다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Option</th><th scope=\"col\">주요 목표</th><th scope=\"col\">Capacity / Hardware</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-Demand</a></td><td>약정 없는 실행</td><td>기본 Capacity 요청</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a></td><td>중단 허용 비용 절감</td><td>회수 가능</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a></td><td>사용 금액 약정 할인</td><td>Capacity 예약 없음</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a></td><td>구성 약정 할인</td><td>Capacity 예약 없음</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Zonal RI</a></td><td>할인·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> Capacity</td><td>특정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 예약</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Host</a></td><td>Host 제어·BYOL</td><td>Physical Host 전용</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instance</a></td><td>계정 단위 Hardware 격리</td><td>Host 지정 불가</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> Capacity 확보</td><td>사용 여부와 별개 과금</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"on-demand-instances\"><h2>On-Demand Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>장기 약정 없이 실제 실행한 Instance 사용량을 지불한다. 짧고 불규칙한 작업이나 처음 시작하는 서비스에 적합하다. 약정 할인보다 단가가 높을 수 있고 요청한 타입·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Capacity가 언제나 확보되는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"spot-instances\"><h2>Spot Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>남는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> Capacity를 할인된 비용으로 사용하지만 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>가 회수할 수 있다. Batch, Rendering, 재시도 가능한 분석처럼 중단을 견디는 작업에 적합하다. 체크포인트·Queue·여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a> Pool을 사용하고 중요한 상태는 외부에 저장한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"spot-interruption-and-rebalance\"><h2>Spot Interruption and Rebalance<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-interruption-and-rebalance\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p>일반적인 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a> 중단은 사전 알림을 제공하지만 Hibernation의 동작은 다르며 알림을 항상 받을 것이라고만 설계하면 안 된다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-interruption-and-rebalance\">Rebalance Recommendation</a>은 Capacity 회수 위험을 미리 신호할 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-interruption-and-rebalance\">Capacity Rebalancing</a>과 작업 재시도는 서로 보완적이다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"spot-fleet-and-ec2-fleet\"><h2>Spot Fleet and EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Fleet<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-fleet-and-ec2-fleet\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-4\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 4\">[4]</a></h2><p>여러 Instance Type·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·구매 옵션으로 목표 Capacity를 요청한다. Allocation Strategy로 Price와 Capacity 위험을 비교한다. Fleet은 구매·용량 관리 수단이며 중단 없는 Instance 보장을 의미하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"compute-savings-plans\"><h2>Compute Savings Plans<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-5\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 5\">[5]</a></h2><p>시간당 USD 사용 금액을 1년 또는 3년 약정한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>의 Family·Size·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>·OS·Tenancy 변화에 유연하고 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">Fargate</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> 사용에도 적용한다. Capacity는 예약하지 않으며 사용이 약정에 못 미치면 미사용 약정 비용이 남는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ec2-instance-savings-plans\"><h2>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Instance Savings Plans<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#ec2-instance-savings-plans\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-5\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 5\">[5]</a></h2><p>특정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 특정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> Instance Family 사용을 약정하는 할인이다. 같은 Family·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 안에서 Size·OS·Tenancy 변경에는 유연하다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Compute Savings Plans</a>보다 적용 범위가 좁으므로 향후 Family·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 이동 계획을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"other-savings-plans\"><h2>Other Savings Plans<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#other-savings-plans\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-5\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 5\">[5]</a></h2><p>현재 문서에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#other-savings-plans\">Database Savings Plans</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#other-savings-plans\">SageMaker AI Savings Plans</a>도 있다. 이들은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 구매 할인과 적용 서비스가 다르다. Savings라는 단어만 보고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>·AI 사용 비용에 동일한 Plan이 적용된다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"standard-reserved-instances\"><h2>Standard Reserved Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#standard-reserved-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-6\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 6\">[6]</a></h2><p>정해진 Instance 속성과 1년·3년 기간에 대한 Billing 할인이다. Convertible보다 할인 폭이 클 수 있지만 교환 유연성은 적다. RI는 실행 중인 Instance 자체가 아니라 일치하는 사용량에 적용하는 예약·할인 계약이다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"convertible-reserved-instances\"><h2>Convertible Reserved Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#convertible-reserved-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-6\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 6\">[6]</a></h2><p>지원 조건에서 다른 Instance 속성의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#convertible-reserved-instances\">Convertible RI</a>로 교환할 수 있다. 장기 사용은 예상되지만 구성 변경이 필요한 경우에 비교한다. 계약의 교환·가치 조건을 따르므로 아무 때나 약정을 취소하는 기능은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\"><h2>Regional and Zonal Reserved Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-7\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 7\">[7]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>는 해당 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 일치하는 사용량 할인에 적용되며 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Zonal RI</a>는 특정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 일치하는 구성에 할인과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>을 제공한다. Size Flexibility 등의 지원 조건도 Scope·OS·Tenancy에 따라 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"all-upfront-partial-upfront-and-no-upfront\"><h2>All Upfront, Partial Upfront and No Upfront<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#all-upfront-partial-upfront-and-no-upfront\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-8\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 8\">[8]</a></h2><p>약정 상품의 결제 방식이다. 선결제 비중과 기간 전체 비용을 비교하되 사용하지 않아도 약정 의무가 남는다는 점은 같다. 가격은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>·OS·상품 조건에 따라 달라 고정 할인율 하나로 모든 구성을 계산하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dedicated-hosts\"><h2>Dedicated Hosts<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-9\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 9\">[9]</a></h2><p>Physical Server 전체를 전용으로 사용하며 Host ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>·Socket·Core와 Instance Placement를 제어한다. Per-socket·Per-core 라이선스의 BYOL과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>가 필요한 경우에 적합하다. Per-host 과금이며 계정 간 Capacity 공유는 지원 방식으로 구성할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dedicated-instances\"><h2>Dedicated Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-10\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 10\">[10]</a></h2><p>한 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 계정에 전용인 Hardware에서 Instance를 실행한다. 다른 계정과 Host를 공유하지 않지만 특정 Host 선택·Socket·Core 확인·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>는 제공하지 않는다. Instance별 과금과 Dedicated 관련 추가 요금이 있으며 BYOL 지원은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Host</a>보다 제한적이다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"on-demand-capacity-reservations\"><h2>On-Demand Capacity Reservations<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-11\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 11\">[11]</a></h2><p>특정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Instance Type·Platform·Tenancy에 맞는 실행 Capacity를 예약한다. Reservation 자체는 할인 상품이 아니고 일치하는 RI·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>의 Billing 혜택과 조합할 수 있다. 사용하지 않은 예약 Capacity도 비용이 발생한다. Future-dated 방식은 약정·취소 조건이 별도로 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"capacity-blocks\"><h2>Capacity Blocks<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#capacity-blocks\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#reference-8\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 8\">[8]</a></h2><p>지원되는 GPU 등 Instance Capacity를 특정 기간에 예약하는 모델이다. AI Training처럼 날짜와 기간을 정한 대규모 Compute 작업에서 검토한다. 지원 타입·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>·기간 조건이 정해져 있어 일반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>의 모든 사용 패턴에 적용되지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>상시 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>는 예측한 최소 사용량에 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>를 적용하고 추가 사용은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-Demand</a>로 운영할 수 있다. 재시도 가능한 야간 Batch는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a>, Socket 기반 라이선스가 있는 서버는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Host</a>를 별도 기준으로 비교한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a>은 강제 중단을 견디기 어려운 단일 상태 저장 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>의 기본 선택이 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-on-demand-instances.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-on-demand-instances.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/using-spot-instances.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/using-spot-instances.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/spot-interruptions.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/spot-interruptions.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-4\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-fleet.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-fleet.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-5\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/savingsplans/latest/userguide/plan-types.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">savingsplans/latest/userguide/plan-types.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-6\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/reserved-instances-types.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/reserved-instances-types.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-7\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/reserved-instances-scope.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/reserved-instances-scope.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-8\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/instance-purchasing-options.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/instance-purchasing-options.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-9\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/dedicated-hosts-overview.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/dedicated-hosts-overview.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-10\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/dedicated-instance.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/dedicated-instance.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-11\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-capacity-reservations.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-capacity-reservations.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q032\" data-question=\"Q032\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q032</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company must use existing per-socket software licenses on EC2 and needs visibility into physical sockets and cores, plus control over instance placement on a specific host. Which option should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>는 Physical Host의 Socket·Core 가시성과 Instance Placement·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 전용 Hardware 격리를 제공하지만 같은 Host 제어·가시성을 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q034\" data-question=\"Q034\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q034</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q034/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A large rendering batch can tolerate interruption and retry. Which EC2 purchasing option can reduce its cost?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q034\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q034\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q034\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q034\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">On-Demand Instances only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a>은 중단 가능 작업에서 유휴 용량 할인을 활용한다. 체크포인트와 재시도를 준비한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q035\" data-question=\"Q035\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q035</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q035/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a stable level of compute usage over a long period. Which commitment-based option can reduce costs compared with On-Demand usage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q035\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q035\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q035\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q035\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 일정 사용량 약정과 교환해 할인한다. 약정 범위와 유형은 사용 패턴에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q046\" data-question=\"Q046\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q046</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q046/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company requires EC2 instances to run on hardware isolated from instances belonging to other AWS accounts. It does not need socket visibility, host affinity, or control over a specific physical server. Which option most directly meets these requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Reserved Instances in shared tenancy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 다른 계정과 Hardware를 분리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>의 Host 제어가 필요하지 않은 요구와 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>는 그 자체로 Dedicated Tenancy를 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q098\" data-question=\"Q098\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q098</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q098/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a Compute Savings Plan but must also ensure that matching EC2 capacity is available in one specific Availability Zone for a launch. Which additional option should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A regional Reserved Instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Spot Fleet with no On-Demand capacity</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 사용 비용 할인이며 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">On-Demand Capacity Reservation</a>은 지정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·구성의 실행 용량을 확보한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>도 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">이전 용어 <b>EC2 Auto Scaling</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">다음 용어 <b>ECS / EKS / Fargate</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
